    "Type": 1,
    "Title": "Show HN: Distilling DeepSeek into GPT-OSS doesn\u0027t transfer censorship. Try it",
    "Url": "https://www.ctgt.ai/research/distillation-censorship-transfer",
    "Description": "We recently used DeepSeek V4 Flash as a teacher for finance tasks with GPT-OSS-120B. Distillation works well on this problem. At a constrained 8k token budget, our self-distilled 120B scores 83.61% on FinanceReasoning, above Kimi K3 (81.93%) and Inkling (65.13%). We released the 20B open weights. With V4 as the teacher though, we realized it would be timely to measure if the censorship characteristic of it transferred to the distilled version of the base model. tl;dr it didn\u0026#x27;t, the teacher ",
    "Metadata": {
